SUMMARY:20's & 30's Full Moon Hike at Mt. Wachusett
LOCATION:82 Westminster R\nPrinceton\, MA 01541
DESCRIPTION:Thursday\, April 30\, 2026 | 7:00 PM\nhttps://activities.outdo
 ors.org/s/oc-activity/a5UVX0000015nPJ2AY/\nJoin us for an evening hike up 
 Mt. Wachusett during an (almost) full moon\, aka\, the Flower Moon! We wi
 ll hike 3-5 miles (depending on if we take a shorter route) with a total e
 levation gain of about 750 ft. Weather permitting\, we plan to spend some 
 time at the summit to enjoy the moon and stars and perhaps some snacks. Th
 e trails will include sections of moderate terrain and we will be moving a
 t a moderate pace.Proper equipment will be required for this hike\, includ
 ing: hiking and weather appropriate clothing\, water\, a day pack\, and a 
 headlamp. No dogs please. 
END:VEVENT
